 - skipping symbols in collapsed sections, live
 - per-tab navigation state
-- a toolbar icon that focuses or opens TWL, with a per-tab NAV badge
+- a toolbar icon that focuses or opens Watchlist, with a per-tab NAV badge
 
 **Out of scope:**
-- any UI injected into TradingView (overlays, panels, buttons)
 - editing lists, flagging or reordering from TradingView
 - timeframes other than 1D and 1W
 - multi-chart layouts (only the active chart is driven)
-- TWL hosted anywhere other than `localhost` / `127.0.0.1`
+- Watchlist hosted anywhere other than `localhost` / `127.0.0.1`
